WEBVTT

00:00.820 --> 00:03.880 position:62.5% size:65% line:85% align:center
Your premium joins those
of many policyholders

00:03.880 --> 00:05.400 position:62.5% size:65% line:85% align:center
to help pay covered claims.

00:06.100 --> 00:07.150 position:62.5% size:65% line:85% align:center
That's risk pooling.

00:08.060 --> 00:09.740 position:62.5% size:65% line:85% align:center
A larger group of similar risks

00:09.740 --> 00:12.100 position:62.5% size:65% line:85% align:center
helps insurers estimate claims
more reliably,

00:12.760 --> 00:15.000 position:62.5% size:65% line:85% align:center
but it can't predict
any one person's future.
